---every endpoint is scoped to the caller's own. Delivery runs through a managed CDP
---destination that is re-provisioned inside the same transaction as every write, so
---config and delivery can't drift apart.
---
---`PUT /api/projects/{project_id}/event_streams/{id}/`
---@param input posthog.customer_analytics.UpdateEventStreamRequest
---@return posthog.customer_analytics.EventStream? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:update_event_stream(input) end

